{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Experimental.local_substrate_q","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Experimental.local_substrate_q","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic"],"declarations":7,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Experimental.LocalSubstrateQ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Experimental.LocalSubstrateQ","kind":"def","line":35,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Experimental/local_substrate_q.lean#L35-L50","doc":"**Content statement** (from manuscript), named as a `Prop`:\n\nIn any sufficiently small neighbourhood `U ⊂ M` of the observable\nuniverse, the substrate parameter `q`\n([substrate parameter](#def:substrate-parameter)) agrees with its\nlocally measured value within the measurement uncertainty:\n\n  `|q − q_measured| ≤ Δq`.\n\nThis is the §3b \"name the conditional conjecture\" disposition (pattern\nC): `LocalSubstrateQ ctx` is the proposition the manuscript conjectures\nfor the substrate data `ctx`; the open state is honestly represented by\nthe absence of an instance.  It is *not* a self-assuming projection. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:prop:local-substrate-q","label":"prop:local-substrate-q","md":"quantum-observable-universe/observations/local-substrate-q.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Experimental.LocalSubstrateQContext.Δq_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Experimental.LocalSubstrateQContext.Δq_pos","kind":"theorem","line":33,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Experimental/local_substrate_q.lean#L33-L33","doc":"The uncertainty is strictly positive. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Experimental.LocalSubstrateQContext.Δq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Experimental.LocalSubstrateQContext.Δq","kind":"def","line":31,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Experimental/local_substrate_q.lean#L31-L31","doc":"Measurement uncertainty `Δq`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Experimental.LocalSubstrateQContext.q_measured","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Experimental.LocalSubstrateQContext.q_measured","kind":"def","line":29,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Experimental/local_substrate_q.lean#L29-L29","doc":"Measured value of `q` at the local observable universe. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Experimental.LocalSubstrateQContext.q","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Experimental.LocalSubstrateQContext.q","kind":"def","line":27,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Experimental/local_substrate_q.lean#L27-L27","doc":"The substrate parameter `q : ℝ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Experimental.LocalSubstrateQContext.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Experimental.LocalSubstrateQContext.mk","kind":"ctor","line":25,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Experimental/local_substrate_q.lean#L25-L25","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Experimental.LocalSubstrateQContext","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Experimental.LocalSubstrateQContext","kind":"class","line":22,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Experimental/local_substrate_q.lean#L22-L33","doc":"Substrate data for the `local_substrate_q` claim: the substrate\nparameter `q`, its locally measured value `q_measured`, and the\nmeasurement uncertainty `Δq > 0`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}